WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:19.450
Theo: We've got to get Frankie out of that trunk.

2
00:00:19.451 --> 00:00:22.121
Ben: He'll die without food and water.

3
00:00:22.122 --> 00:00:24.504
Theo: Don't worry, Frankie.

4
00:00:24.505 --> 00:00:28.706
We'll get you out!

5
00:00:28.707 --> 00:00:30.978
Frankie: Ribbit! Ribbit!

6
00:00:30.979 --> 00:00:33.697
Sarah: Frankie sounds scared.

7
00:00:33.698 --> 00:00:35.685
Skyler: And thirsty.

8
00:00:35.686 --> 00:00:42.687
Snooks: Ah-choo!

9
00:00:42.688 --> 00:00:45.358
Ben: Maybe we could break the trunk open.

10
00:00:45.359 --> 00:00:49.197
Theo: I don't want to hurt Frankie!

11
00:00:49.198 --> 00:00:52.458
Skyler: Look, Chatter has something in his beak.

12
00:00:52.459 --> 00:00:56.576
Riley: A shiny, gold key!

13
00:00:56.577 --> 00:00:58.687
Ben: It is a key.

14
00:00:58.688 --> 00:01:01.069
Maybe it's the key to the trunk.

15
00:01:01.070 --> 00:01:06.501
Skyler: Chatter, let me have the key.

16
00:01:06.502 --> 00:01:09.798
Sarah: He doesn't want to let it go.

17
00:01:09.799 --> 00:01:13.674
Skyler: Chatter, open your beak!

18
00:01:13.675 --> 00:01:15.621
Chatter: No!

19
00:01:15.622 --> 00:01:18.331
Kids: Ha-ha!

20
00:01:18.332 --> 00:01:25.696
Skyler: Thank you, Chatter.

21
00:01:25.697 --> 00:01:34.558
Theo: I wish for this key to work.

22
00:01:34.559 --> 00:01:36.959
Ben: Hooray!

23
00:01:36.960 --> 00:01:40.543
Frankie: Ribbit! Ribbit!

24
00:01:40.544 --> 00:01:43.685
Sarah: The key worked like magic.

25
00:01:43.686 --> 00:01:47.739
Riley: Hmm. That makes me wonder.

26
00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:49.235
Ben: What?

27
00:01:49.236 --> 00:01:56.322
Riley: What if this key really is magic?

28
00:01:56.323 --> 00:01:58.216
Skyler: What do you mean?

29
00:01:58.217 --> 00:02:03.092
Riley: Well, Theo made a wish that the key would work.

30
00:02:03.093 --> 00:02:05.277
Theo: And it did!

31
00:02:05.278 --> 00:02:10.181
Ben: Let's try another wish.

32
00:02:10.182 --> 00:02:13.617
Riley: Be careful what you wish for.

33
00:02:13.618 --> 00:02:15.543
Sarah: Why?

34
00:02:15.544 --> 00:02:18.890
Riley: Because your wish may come true.

35
00:02:18.891 --> 00:02:24.697
That's what my mom always says.

36
00:02:24.698 --> 00:02:28.153
Theo: We want our wishes to come true.

37
00:02:28.154 --> 00:02:33.038
Riley: We should still think carefully about our next wish.

38
00:02:33.039 --> 00:02:37.880
Skyler: Let me make a wish! I wish—

39
00:02:37.881 --> 00:02:45.241
Theo: For the Pet Lovers Club to become famous!
